  Hypothesis RBD : rng RNG BD 40.
  Hypothesis RS : rng RNG S (zlen bs).
  Hypothesis RSTK : rng RNG (bv_unsigned sp - 16) 16.
  Hypothesis AW : appW [(bv_unsigned sp + -16, bv_unsigned sp); (DS, DS + 16); (BD, BD + 40)].

